   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PG DCAC Vocational Schools India</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PG DCAC Vocational Schools India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is to promote Vocational education and training for      youth in India. The Vocational school will contribute to the          development of a larger pool of skilled industrial workers in India   where as per the growing demands from the Indian industries. This     will address the issue of &quot;Right to Work&quot;. The cooperation will       facilitate the promotion of skill enhancement of rural youth.</narrative>
